				<r3d:description language="eng">VegBank is the vegetation plot database of the Ecological Society of America&#039;s Panel on Vegetation Classification. VegBank consists of three linked databases that contain  the actual plot records,  vegetation types recognized in the U.S. National Vegetation Classification and other vegetation types submitted by users, and  all plant taxa recognized by ITIS/USDA as well as all other plant taxa recorded in plot records. Vegetation records, community types and plant taxa may be submitted to VegBank and may be subsequently searched, viewed, annotated, revised, interpreted, downloaded, and cited. VegBank receives its data from the VegBank community of users.</r3d:description>
